From be5c434fd7fd7c752a9651d714bf12bfb060ddc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JSwetz <Johnswetz1982@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 05:50:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(motion): stop inter-level rapid at feed height above
 prior floor in 3D Pocket

Update descent::from to add plunge_height above mat_top on subsequent levels.

Stop rapid between levels at feed height margin and feed the remaining drop.

Regenerate example catalog case 3d/rough-finish with lowest G0 at Z12.

Add test pinning the feed height clearance margin in case_3d_rough_finish.

Fixes #3671
